            <h1 class="single-title">The Scanners Mapping AI Infrastructure Aren&#x27;t After Your Model. They&#x27;re After Your Credentials.</h1>

                <div class="single-excerpt">
                    460 source IPs, 11,643 requests, 72 hours against exposed AI infrastructure. The operators that recognised it were cataloguing; the ones attacking were after credentials that sit on any exposed host.
                </div>

            <div class="author-name" style="display: none;"><a href="/author/shakel-ahmed/">Shakel Ahmed</a></div>

